s("plus_giftReceived", "Someone here sent you a {gift}.", "What the recipient sees (PRD). Never who sent it.", "ఇక్కడ ఎవరో మీకు {gift} పంపారు.", "Ikkada evaro meeku {gift} pampaaru.", STR("gift"))
